export const levels=[['none','Без уровня',0],['three','3 уровень',0],['two','2 уровень',15],['one','1 уровень',30],['highest','Высший уровень',70]];
export const factors=[1030,1037,1040,1105,1076,1040];
export function indexedSalary(base){if(!Number.isInteger(base)||base<=0)throw Error('Некорректный оклад');return factors.reduce((v,k)=>Math.ceil(v*k/1000),base);}
export function ageGroup(age){if(!Number.isInteger(age)||age<18||age>100)throw Error('Укажите возраст от 18 до 100 лет');return age<25?1:Math.min(9,Math.floor((age-25)/5)+2);}
export function allowance(salary,level){if(!Number.isInteger(salary)||salary<1)throw Error('Некорректный оклад');const row=levels.find(x=>x[0]===level);if(!row)throw Error('Выберите уровень');const percent=row[2];return {percent,amount:Math.round(salary*percent)/100};}
export function sumPoints(values){if(values.some(v=>v===''||v===null||!Number.isInteger(Number(v))||Number(v)<0||Number(v)>100))return null;return values.reduce((a,b)=>a+Number(b),0);}
export function gap(total,target){if(total===null||!Number.isFinite(target))return null;return Math.max(0,target-total);}
export function profile(sex,age,category,data){let group=ageGroup(age);if(sex==='women')group=Math.min(group,7);const older=sex==='women'?group>=6:group>=7;const count=older?2:sex==='men'&&Number(category)===1?4:3;const thresholds=sex==='women'?data.thresholds.women['age_category_'+group]:older?data.thresholds.older['age_category_'+group]:data.thresholds.men['age_category_'+group]['category_'+category];return {sex,age,group,category:Number(category),older,count,thresholds,minimum:data.minimum[sex]['age_category_'+group]};}
export function tableFor(exercise,p,data){const id=String(exercise);let key=id;if(['17','18','19','23','24','25','26','27','28','29','45'].includes(id))key=id+(p.age>=35?'_2':'_1');const t=data.scores[key];if(!t)throw Error('Для выбранного упражнения не найдена таблица');return t;}
export function parseResult(raw,unit){let s=String(raw).trim();if(!s)return null;let v;if(unit==='time'){let m=s.match(/^(\d+)[:.,](\d{2})$/);if(!m||Number(m[2])>59)throw Error('Время укажи как минуты:секунды, например 14:30');v=Number(m[1])*60+Number(m[2]);}else{if(!/^\d+(?:[.,]\d+)?$/.test(s))throw Error('Введи число без букв');v=Number(s.replace(',','.'));if(['reps','hits','grade','variant'].includes(unit)&&!Number.isInteger(v))throw Error('Укажи целое число');}if(!Number.isFinite(v)||v<0||v>100000)throw Error('Проверь результат');if(['time','seconds'].includes(unit)&&v===0)throw Error('Время должно быть больше нуля');if((unit==='hits'||unit==='variant')&&v>3)throw Error('Число попаданий: от 0 до 3');if(unit==='grade'&&(v<2||v>5))throw Error('Оценка: от 2 до 5');return v;}
export function pointsFor(table,value){if(value===null)return null;const valid=table.values.filter(([n])=>table.direction==='max'?value>=n:value<=n);return valid.length?Math.max(...valid.map(x=>x[1])):0;}
export function assessment(points,p){if(points.some(n=>n===null))return {complete:false,total:null,grade:null,level:null};const total=points.reduce((a,b)=>a+b,0);const failed=points.map((n,i)=>n<p.minimum?i:-1).filter(i=>i>=0);let key='k2';if(!failed.length)for(const k of ['k3','k4','three','two','one','highest'])if(total>=p.thresholds[k])key=k;return {complete:true,total,failed,grade:key==='k2'?2:key==='k3'?3:key==='k4'?4:5,level:['three','two','one','highest'].includes(key)?key:'none'};}
export function nextGoal(result,p){if(!result.complete)return null;for(const k of ['three','two','one','highest'])if(p.thresholds[k]>result.total||result.failed.length)return {level:k,target:p.thresholds[k],missing:Math.max(0,p.thresholds[k]-result.total)};return null;}
export function improvement(table,current,requiredPoints){if(current===null)return null;const candidates=table.values.filter(([,b])=>b>=requiredPoints);if(!candidates.length)return null;const target=table.direction==='max'?Math.min(...candidates.map(x=>x[0])):Math.max(...candidates.map(x=>x[0]));return{target,delta:Math.max(0,table.direction==='max'?target-current:current-target)};}
export function formatResult(value,unit){if(unit==='time'){let v=Math.round(value);return `${Math.floor(v/60)}:${String(v%60).padStart(2,'0')}`;}return String(Math.round(value*100)/100).replace('.',',')+(unit==='seconds'?' с':unit==='meters'?' м':unit==='reps'?' раз':unit==='hits'?' попад.':'');}
